## Transport streams and bitmap subtitles

M2T, MTS, and M2TS workflows include specialized subtitle handling for PGS, DVB subtitles, DVB teletext, ARIB captions, and HDMV sources where compatible. M2T converts PGS/DVD bitmap subtitles to standard DVB subtitles rather than placing them in private data.

For broadcast or disc workflows, verify the exported stream in the target tool. These formats have stricter compatibility rules than a typical web video.
